      "bullets": [
        "An advanced AI model output disproved the long-standing Maxwell Conjecture in potential theory by constructing an explicit counterexample.",
        "Demonstrates the growing capability of frontier reasoning models to resolve open problems in mathematical physics.",
        "Highlights automated counterexample search as a key application for LLMs alongside formal proof verification systems."
      ]
    },
    {
